identifies the office that will review the submittal for the Government.</TAI>  Submit the following in accordance with Section[ <SRF>01 33 00</SRF> SUBMITTAL PROCEDURES][ 
01 33 00.05 20 CONSTRUCTION SUBMITTAL PROCEDURES]:</TXT><BRK/>
